    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1334960/extras/c864fff507cd10898c028c505c3facae.avif?t=1745552277\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are <strong>Purrseus</strong>, hero of ancient Greece, tasked by the Gods to <strong>prove your wisdom and might</strong> by overcoming a series of <strong>challenging trials</strong>. You'll contend with <strong>puzzles, traps, monsters</strong>, and all manner of environmental danger on your <strong>epic journey</strong>. But fear not! At your disposal will be many <strong>amazing and magical items</strong>. Some trials may require you to <strong>enlist the aid of Fursephone,</strong> Purrseus' sister and fellow hero!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>PROVE YOUR WORTH, HEROES!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1334960/extras/dcee504457394132ba3ba38d96a23649.poster.avif?t=1745552277\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1334960/extras/dcee504457394132ba3ba38d96a23649.webm?t=1745552277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1334960/extras/dcee504457394132ba3ba38d96a23649.mp4?t=1745552277\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>One or two heroes</strong> can take on the many puzzling and challenging trials. Choose your actions wisely, heroes, and use teamwork when necessary! Solve each level's mysteries, <strong>collect the gems, get to the exit</strong>, ready to take on the next challenge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>AVOID MONSTERS AND DEADLY TRAPS!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1334960/extras/38391d5dbec4a3a88a1d9435cbfaafa3.poster.avif?t=1745552277\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1334960/extras/38391d5dbec4a3a88a1d9435cbfaafa3.webm?t=1745552277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1334960/extras/38391d5dbec4a3a88a1d9435cbfaafa3.mp4?t=1745552277\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Many dangers await you! <strong>Vile and deadly monsters</strong> such as the Gorgon, Cyclops, Minotaur, and more will stand between you and success. <strong>Fire, Ice, and Lightning traps</strong> will require special strategy and care to avoid!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>USE MAGICAL ITEMS TO AID IN YOUR ADVENTURE!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1334960/extras/dba9057329663d1a51f1e5eaf76e1bf9.poster.avif?t=1745552277\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1334960/extras/dba9057329663d1a51f1e5eaf76e1bf9.webm?t=1745552277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1334960/extras/dba9057329663d1a51f1e5eaf76e1bf9.mp4?t=1745552277\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The many levels are loaded with <strong>helpful items</strong> such as the amulet of strength, the ice bow, firepots, the teleporter staff, the reverser wand, keys, the portal bident, and more! <strong>Use them wisely,</strong> for they may spell the difference between success and failure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>GAME FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Single and MultiCat modes for <strong>one or two players</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Local\u00a0<strong>Coop</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Single player mode allows for play on 2-player levels via <strong>switching of heroes with one controller</strong> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>High scores</strong> tracked for time, moves, and efficiency in all game modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bronze/Silver/Gold Medals</strong> for each score category and game mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Original <strong>soundtrack</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dozens</strong> of devious levels </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Designed to challenge <strong>all skill levels</strong></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1334960/extras/c864fff507cd10898c028c505c3facae.avif?t=1745552277\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are <strong>Purrseus</strong>, hero of ancient Greece, tasked by the Gods to <strong>prove your wisdom and might</strong> by overcoming a series of <strong>challenging trials</strong>. You'll contend with <strong>puzzles, traps, monsters</strong>, and all manner of environmental danger on your <strong>epic journey</strong>. But fear not! At your disposal will be many <strong>amazing and magical items</strong>. Some trials may require you to <strong>enlist the aid of Fursephone,</strong> Purrseus' sister and fellow hero!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>PROVE YOUR WORTH, HEROES!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1334960/extras/dcee504457394132ba3ba38d96a23649.poster.avif?t=1745552277\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1334960/extras/dcee504457394132ba3ba38d96a23649.webm?t=1745552277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1334960/extras/dcee504457394132ba3ba38d96a23649.mp4?t=1745552277\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>One or two heroes</strong> can take on the many puzzling and challenging trials. Choose your actions wisely, heroes, and use teamwork when necessary! Solve each level's mysteries, <strong>collect the gems, get to the exit</strong>, ready to take on the next challenge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>AVOID MONSTERS AND DEADLY TRAPS!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1334960/extras/38391d5dbec4a3a88a1d9435cbfaafa3.poster.avif?t=1745552277\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1334960/extras/38391d5dbec4a3a88a1d9435cbfaafa3.webm?t=1745552277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1334960/extras/38391d5dbec4a3a88a1d9435cbfaafa3.mp4?t=1745552277\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Many dangers await you! <strong>Vile and deadly monsters</strong> such as the Gorgon, Cyclops, Minotaur, and more will stand between you and success. <strong>Fire, Ice, and Lightning traps</strong> will require special strategy and care to avoid!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>USE MAGICAL ITEMS TO AID IN YOUR ADVENTURE!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1334960/extras/dba9057329663d1a51f1e5eaf76e1bf9.poster.avif?t=1745552277\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1334960/extras/dba9057329663d1a51f1e5eaf76e1bf9.webm?t=1745552277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1334960/extras/dba9057329663d1a51f1e5eaf76e1bf9.mp4?t=1745552277\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The many levels are loaded with <strong>helpful items</strong> such as the amulet of strength, the ice bow, firepots, the teleporter staff, the reverser wand, keys, the portal bident, and more! <strong>Use them wisely,</strong> for they may spell the difference between success and failure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>GAME FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Single and MultiCat modes for <strong>one or two players</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Local\u00a0<strong>Coop</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Single player mode allows for play on 2-player levels via <strong>switching of heroes with one controller</strong> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>High scores</strong> tracked for time, moves, and efficiency in all game modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bronze/Silver/Gold Medals</strong> for each score category and game mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Original <strong>soundtrack</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dozens</strong> of devious levels </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Designed to challenge <strong>all skill levels</strong></p></li></ul>",
